enly. Roll out the remaining dough and place on top of the almond paste. Incorporate 8.3 tbsp butter, 10 tbsp milk, 1.33 cup almond paste, 1 whole egg, 1 for brushing milk, and 1 garnish almonds smoothly until evenly distributed."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Bake Gevulde speculaas & Check Doneness"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Bake for 30 minutes until the edges turn golden and set while the center remains tender. Test with a toothpick—if it comes out with a few moist crumbs rather than wet batter, it is ready."}]]}],["$","li","4",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Cool, Garnish & Serve"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Brush the top with the remaining beaten egg. Garnish with almonds and top with another layer of egg wash. Bake the filled speculaas for 40 minutes at 180°C/350℉ (conventional oven) or until done."}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","viral-4",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/crispy-pistachio-kunafa-cheese-roll/","children":"Crispy Pistachio Kunafa Cheese Roll"}]}],["$","li","viral-14",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/thai-coconut-mango-sticky-rice-parfait/","children":"Thai Coconut Mango Sticky Rice Parfait"}]}],["$","li","viral-17",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/cardamom-saffron-rasmalai-milk-cake/","children":"Cardamom Saffron Rasmalai Milk Cake"}]}],["$","li","viral-18",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/warm-honey-cardamom-gulab-jamun/","children":"Warm Honey Cardamom Gulab Jamun"}]}],["$","li","mdb-53120",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/bleskiver/","children":"Æbleskiver"}]}],["$","li","mdb-53049",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/apam-balik/","children":"Apam balik"}]}]]}]]}]}]
